         Disk must add any paid `extraDiskGB` expansion on top of the base
         plan/gameplan size — capacity.ts, node-capacity.ts, and
         disk-expand.ts all read the real total via `effectiveDiskGB`, but
         this list was showing the bare base size, understating a customer's
         actual (and already-provisioned) disk by however much they'd paid
         to expand it. Found live 2026-09-17: a customer with a base 25GB
